    "detailed_description": "RESOURCE RECON is an exciting game in which you take on the role of a brave miner who goes searching for rare materials in the depths of the earth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour main goal is to collect valuable resources and minerals that can only be found in the most dangerous and exciting places underground. However, on your way there will be various dangers and enemies who will try to stop you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will not only have to skillfully search and mine materials, but also fight enemies using a pickaxe and bombs to protect yourself and survive in this dangerous world. Each new depth of the earth will reveal new secrets and dangers, and only the most courageous and skillful players will be able to obtain the rarest materials.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShow off your miner skills, fight enemies and dive into the exciting world of underground adventures.",
